{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV綜藝節目《直樂 VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》昨晚（3日）播出最新一集，多 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV綜藝節目《直樂 VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》昨晚（3日）播出最新一集，多對男女參賽者的感情線迎來大洗牌。眾人在爭奪合宿之旅資格的過程中，有人勇敢直球示愛，亦有人在深入交流後關係急轉直下。一向形象堅強的女參賽者在約會期間情緒失控落淚，背後隱藏着令人意想不到的轉折。</p>\n<h2>Chuck咖啡廳突發表白Muji首度大膽示愛</h2>\n<p>男參賽者在此環節需要盲選約會場地，進而引發連串變數。Chuck憑藉過往對Muji喜好的了解，成功在咖啡廳與對方見面，互動期間他主動試探女方期望。當Muji坦承希望兩人有單獨約會機會時，Chuck隨即投下震撼彈，當面直認「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」更揚言希望在旅程中尋找Soulmate，而目前正與該名靈魂伴侶共進晚餐，令女方面紅耳赤。另一邊廂，Howard即使內心想與宇夫互動，最終仍跟隨自己想法選擇最刺激越野車項目，並期盼能巧遇對方。</p>\n<h2>Kenneth與丁丁農莊體驗觸發真誠對話</h2>\n<p>截然不同的約會氛圍同時在傳統農莊部落上演，Kenneth與丁丁首次配對成功並換上傳統服飾體驗製作麻糬。兩人在過程中不斷互相鬥嘴與搞笑，氣氛起初相當融洽。然而隨着話題逐漸深入，雙方展開一場毫無保留的真誠對話，Kenneth在傾談後罕有地直接向對方表示感到後悔。這番言論瞬間擊潰丁丁心理防線，令平時展現Tough女強人姿態的她當場感動落淚，兩人關係在約會後出現巨大轉變。</p>\n<h2>邱比特獻計延續配對翊行慘遭宇夫冷待</h2>\n<p>節目由陳俞希與練美娟聯手主持，並特別邀請《全民造星4》出身女團COLLAR三位成員沈貞巧、陳泳伽與許軼擔任邱比特，為眾人出謀獻策。今季節目延續上一季成功配對者基礎，再加入全新參賽者試圖擾亂原有戀愛局面。以翊行及宇夫為例，翊行如願在農莊與心儀對象見面並瘋狂散發好感，甚至公開表示覺得雙方最為合適。可惜宇夫未有接受這份熱情，反而直接建議對方應該多認識其他參賽者，未有正面回應對方。</p>\n<h2>丁丁爆喊惹網民心痛Chuck直球告白獲讚賞</h2>\n<p>隨着各組約會情節曝光，參賽者之間錯綜複雜的互動隨即成為網上熱話。不少觀眾對於Chuck能夠把握機會大膽表白感到驚喜，紛紛留言「直球對決真係好有勇氣」、「Soulmate嗰句直接命中紅心」。同時亦有大批網民對丁丁落淚一幕大感愕然，認為女強人展現脆弱一面極具衝擊力，留言表示「見到丁丁喊覺得好心痛」、「Kenneth到底講咗咩令到佢咁激動」。網上持續湧現關於眾人合宿名單最終走向相關留言。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043480729973_5301817076aea9cb3610f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’02”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043480729973_5301817076aea9cb3610f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043680369824_8671562566aea9cb50b358.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’03” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043680369824_8671562566aea9cb50b358.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043860882378_19733424446aea9cb6f1a99.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’08”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043860882378_19733424446aea9cb6f1a99.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044057094497_11019833296aea9cb8f3345.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 丁丁.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044057094497_11019833296aea9cb8f3345.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 丁丁（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044251679799_9193298766aea9cbab5d54.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 宇夫.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044251679799_9193298766aea9cbab5d54.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 宇夫（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044475742229_6664433606aea9cbd112e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"而平時一向好Tough的女強人丁丁更感動落淚！.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044475742229_6664433606aea9cbd112e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>而平時一向好Tough的女強人丁丁更感動落淚！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937604464939686_682917726aea9cbed3518.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Angel.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937604464939686_682917726aea9cbed3518.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Angel（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044803832163_20434975916aea9cc051c0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Muji.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044803832163_20434975916aea9cc051c0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Muji（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044959959423_11102069286aea9cc1dfe40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"雖然翊行超心心眼宇夫，更表示覺得與對方最適合，但宇夫反而想叫翊行認識一下其他人。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044959959423_11102069286aea9cc1dfe40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>雖然翊行超心心眼宇夫，更表示覺得與對方最適合，但宇夫反而想叫翊行認識一下其他人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045137713763_12686012966aea9cc394493.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chuck此時突然心動表白：「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」令Muji面都紅埋。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045137713763_12686012966aea9cc394493.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Chuck此時突然心動表白：「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」令Muji面都紅埋。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045278996526_18226860416aea9cc518edd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kenneth與丁丁在傳統農莊部落穿着傳統服飾，體驗製作麻糬等。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045278996526_18226860416aea9cc518edd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kenneth與丁丁在傳統農莊部落穿着傳統服飾，體驗製作麻糬等。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9b%b4%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">直樂</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9c%9f%e4%ba%ba%e9%a8%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">真人騷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e4%bf%9e%e5%b8%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳俞希</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535540\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:12.794465+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1701,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:47:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:39:17.670423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:56.686657+00:00","content_hash":"949bdea65edfae9296b65f5f8b91ac7ddc361a85c10dddc9f99b6874b9c41e04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}